      "coverage": [
        "platform fee rounds up; a one base unit price still reserves its whole fee",
        "publication refuses an underfunded ceiling and leaves the brief a draft",
        "publication, budget authorization and status changes are owner-only",
        "a later terms revision does not change the live offer until republished and re-checked",
        "a claim pins the published terms version and build and reserves the itemized maximum liability",
        "concurrent claims for the last slot admit exactly one operator; the ceiling holds",
        "a forced UPDATE beyond the ceiling is refused by the table check",
        "budget exhaustion stops claims; later authorization admits the next one",
        "unqualified and unadmitted operators are refused with distinct reasons",
        "lease renewal stays inside the delivery deadline; a wrong token is refused",
        "expiry fences a live runner, returns the reservation and frees the slot; re-claim is a new attempt",
        "release returns a reservation exactly once and refuses a second release",
        "reclassification moves money once, releases the remainder and refuses exceeding the commitment",
        "settlement moves accepted to finalized without changing the total",
        "cancellation drains live work and preserves an accepted obligation across a revoked authorization",
        "pause stops claims and hides the campaign; reopening restores both",
        "the builder ledger view reconciles, omits attempt tokens, and audits reviewer reads",
        "a claim inside a rolled back transaction leaves no assignment and no reservation",
        "an unpublished or unfunded campaign is never offered and cannot be claimed"
