  "limitations": [
    "Acceptance and rejection exist only as ledger primitives; no HTTP route can accept work, because decisions need ALPHA-05 evidence and ALPHA-06 criteria",
    "No payouts, resource purchases, fee collection or on-chain settlement; the finalize primitive is untested against a real transfer",
    "The declared spending authorization is not verified on chain and is not escrow; funding may not exist",
    "Assignments end only by release, expiry or campaign cancellation in this step",
    "No campaign completion, automatic pause on lost payment authority, appeals, or qualification reset",
    "No runner isolation, scoped execution credentials or evidence ingestion; nothing is actually executed",
    "Expired challenges, credentials, idempotency keys and lapsed rows are not cleaned up",
    "Independent operator review and funded resource proof remain open from M1",
    "Axe and Chromium mobile emulation do not establish complete accessibility or real-device coverage"
